# Security & Privacy

## Secrets
- ✅ No API keys in repo
- ✅ Use flavors + CI secrets + runtime config (`--dart-define`)
- ✅ Config files in `lib/config/{local,dev,prod}.dart` + `AppConfig` are for non-secret environment values (e.g. base URLs)

## Tokens
- ✅ Store tokens in secure storage (`SecureTokenStorage`)
- ✅ Avoid keeping tokens in memory longer than necessary; `authTokenProvider` is in-memory only (headers convenience), not the source of truth
- ✅ Always clear tokens on logout

## PII
- ✅ Don’t log PII
- ✅ Minimize data collection; document any analytics events

## Permissions
- ✅ Request permissions just-in-time
- ✅ Handle denial gracefully

## NEVER
- ❌ Hardcode credentials
- ❌ Log authorization headers, tokens, email addresses, etc.
- ❌ Disable TLS verification outside `AppEnvironment.local`
